## Problem Statement – Gym Member Management Using Stack and Queue

Develop a Gym Member Management System using Stack and Queue to perform the following operations:
Insert Record: Add a new gym member's ID, name, and membership type to the stack or queue.
Delete Record: Remove the most recently added member from the stack or the first added member from the queue.
Display Stack: Display all gym members stored in the stack.
Display Queue: Display all gym members stored in the queue.
Exit: Terminate the program.
